Conclusion:
An active task Agent at /worker has caller.agentRunId equal to its exact taskAgentRunId while the immutable node at /worker retains run-worker. TaskDelegationTargetMapper rejects this valid current task Agent before TaskDelegationService can validate taskAgentInstance against TaskAgentDirectory. This blocks nested delegate_task from an active task Agent. No API/E2E source edit was made.
